<LanguageData>
  <VQE_AncientLabComplex.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameDef], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has intercepted a mysterious broadcast. The signal carries encryption markers associated with an ancient military supersoldier program, and appears to have been transmitted from a site not far from our colony. \n\n[asker_nameDef] believes that tracking this signal will reveal the location of a hidden installation. On arrival, scouts reported finding a small, abandoned surface outpost with an open vault entrance leading deep underground.\n\nBeneath lies a sealed laboratory complex. Inside must be some kind of ancient broadcasting station - intercepting the signal from it will allow us to trace its destination. \n\nThe underground vault also contains something invaluable: an intact Archogen Injector. This rare device can be used to begin creating supersoldiers by injecting archites directly into human subjects. The injector, along with any other surviving lab equipment, should be claimed and brought back to the colony. \n\nThe lab itself shows no active defenders, but ancient traps may still be functional and must be navigated with care.-->
    <li>[asker_faction_name] 的 questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;[asker_nameDef]、[asker_faction_leaderTitle] 截获了一条神秘广播。该信号带有与古代军事超级士兵计划相关的加密标记，并且似乎是从离我们殖民地不远的一个站点传输的。 

[asker_nameDef] 认为跟踪此信号将揭示隐藏装置的位置。到达后，侦察兵报告称发现了一个小型的、废弃的地表前哨基地，有一个通向地下深处的开放式金库入口。

下面是一个密封的实验室综合体。里面肯定有某种古老的广播电台——截获它的信号就能让我们追踪到它的目的地。 

地下金库还包含一些无价的东西：一个完整​​的 Archogen 注射器。这种罕见的装置可用于通过将阿奇特直接注射到人类受试者体内来开始创造超级士兵。注射器以及任何其他幸存的实验室设备应该被认领并带回殖民地。 

实验室本身没有活跃的防御者，但古老的陷阱可能仍然有效，必须小心操作。</li>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==True)->We've intercepted an unstable remote broadcast, requesting reinforcements for some unknown event. While seemingly not intended for us, the signal appears to originate from a laboratory responsible for producing ancient supersoldiers. \n\nThe site must contain the broadcasting station responsible for the message. It is imperative that we intercept the broadcast on-site, to track where it is broadcasting to. \n\nThis trek might be dangerous, as we have no way of knowing what lies at the site. Remaining technology at the site could prove useful, we should look at each piece of equipment carefully to take back with us if we dream of creating supersoldiers of our own.-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==True)-&gt;我们截获了不稳定的远程广播，请求增援以应对某些未知事件。虽然信号似乎不是针对我们的，但它似乎源自一个负责生产古代超级士兵的实验室。 

该站点必须包含负责该消息的广播电台。我们必须在现场拦截广播，以追踪广播的目的地。 

这次长途跋涉可能很危险，因为我们无法知道现场有什么。现场剩余的技术可能会被证明是有用的，如果我们梦想创造自己的超级士兵，我们应该仔细查看每件装备，然后带回去。</li>
  </VQE_AncientLabComplex.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_AncientLabComplex.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Supersoldier lab-->
    <li>questName-&gt;超级士兵实验室</li>
  </VQE_AncientLabComplex.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_AncientResearchVault.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->Your radio lights up with another request for E352. The automated satellite tells you of another vault, lurking somewhere in the distance. This vault is marked one of many in a series of "seized vaults", where supersoldier patients sealed off the genetic monstrosities underground. \n\nThe site briefing attatched reads as follows:\n[story]\n\n The satellite wants you to take care of the supersoldiers, then reopen the vault door. It refuses to elaborate on what the purpose of the mission is. Your only directive is to re-open the underground section of the vault. Once it has been unsealed, you may leave or loot the site for ancient technology.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;您的无线电亮起，发出另一个 E352 请求。自动卫星会告诉你另一个金库，潜伏在远处的某个地方。这个金库是一系列“被夺取的金库”中的一个，超级士兵患者将基因怪物封锁在地下。 

所附的现场简报内容如下：
[story]

 卫星希望你解决超级士兵，然后重新打开金库门。它拒绝详细说明此次任务的目的是什么。你唯一的指令是重新打开金库的地下部分。一旦它被解封，你就可以离开或掠夺该地点以获取古代技术。</li>
    <!--EN: story->This vault's patients guard the exterior, after they heard rumors of letting the monstrosities roam free. Afraid for their descendants, they staged an uprising to stop the entire operation. They took out several doctors then rushed to seal the massive underground vault door. After some deliberation, a group of patients decided to remain at the site. Choosing to give their lives to ensure their captors don't return to unleash the horrors onto the world was their way of keeping their families safe.-->
    <li>story-&gt;这个避难所的病人在听到让怪物自由漫步的传言后守卫着外部。由于担心自己的后代，他们发动起义来停止整个行动。他们救出了几名医生，然后冲上去封住了巨大的地下金库大门。经过深思熟虑，一群病人决定留在现场。选择献出自己的生命，以确保绑架者不会回来给世界带来恐怖，这是他们保护家人安全的方式。</li>
    <!--EN: story->This vault contained a cult born from captivity. Through an experiment, a patient gained a powerful ability based around the external manipulation of the inner-self. He took it upon himself to thrust his ideology onto the other patients, until a unity of intention formed among the captives. They were to seize this site for themselves, and guard it as a beacon to their new leader. Executives heard this rumor, and chose to capture him. Strapped to machines, they numbed his synapses and attempted to remove his ability with experimental treatments. As the cult burst out of containment and stormed the halls, they were unaware of the state of their leader as they mercilessly took revenge on their captors. After escaping the underground vault, the members sealed the door and stood to guard their temple. It remains unclear whether the leader managed to escape, or became a monstrosity himself in their process of detainment.-->
    <li>story-&gt;这个金库里有一个从囚禁中诞生的邪教。通过一项实验，患者获得了一种基于外部操纵内在自我的强大能力。他亲自将自己的意识形态推强加给其他病人，直到俘虏们形成了统一的意图。他们要为自己夺取这个地盘，并把它当作新领导人的灯塔来守护。高管们听到了这个谣言，并选择抓捕他。他们把他绑在机器上，麻木了他的突触，并试图通过实验性治疗消除他的能力。当邪教冲出收容并冲进大厅时，他们并不知道他们的领袖的状态，因为他们无情地向抓捕者进行报复。逃离地下金库后，成员们封锁了大门，站在那里守卫他们的神殿。目前还不清楚这名领导人是成功逃脱，还是在拘留过程中自己变成了怪物。</li>
    <!--EN: story->Those who surround the vault guard a terrible secret. A patient was given the remarkable ability of telepathy through an experiment. The doctors were shocked as the man divulged specific details about their private lives. After being placed with the other patients, it is said the telepath began to disturb them with his accuracy. He began to unearth intimate details about their personal affairs, and the secrets they kept buried. Things changed when he looked at a disheveled patient for too long and heard a piece of information too dark to bear. The patients arranged to have the telepath killed, but executives intervened. The telepath used that opportunity to read the layout of the vault from one of the doctor's thoughts, and unseal the vault door. As he and a handful of other patients reached the surface, the disheveled man kicked the telepath back downstairs into the vault. Him and the other patients agreed to keep him sealed there forever, guarding their buried secrets with the horrors underneath.-->
    <li>story-&gt;金库周围的人守护着一个可怕的秘密。一名患者通过实验获得了非凡的心灵感应能力。当该男子透露了他们私生活的具体细节时，医生们感到震惊。据说，在与其他病人安置在一起后，心灵感应者开始用他的准确性打扰他们。他开始挖掘亲密关于他们个人事务的细节，以及他们隐藏的秘密。当他盯着一个衣冠不整的病人太久，并听到一条黑暗得难以忍受的信息时，事情发生了变化。患者们安排杀死心灵感应者，但高管进行了干预。心灵感应者利用这个机会从医生的一个想法中读取了金库的布局，并打开了金库的门。当他和其他几个病人到达地面时，那个衣衫不整的男人把心灵感应器踢回到楼下的金库里。他和其他病人同意把他封印在那里永远，用下面的恐怖来守护他们埋藏的秘密。</li>
    <!--EN: story->This vault is guarded by a loyal group of friends. The underground halls once contained a gifted patient with the ability to manipulate her form. She could transform into anything on a whim. The doctors would bring out turtles and rabbits to test her skill, and through a painful melting process she was able to form a shell and become unmistakably a turtle. Overtime, this process became too grueling to tolerate. She was well-liked among the other patients, and they ended up taking great pity on her. On one night, they convinced the girl to melt into the form of a doctor to stage a breakout. She managed to bring all her friends to the vault door in her disguise, but was said to have instead accidentally unleashed a wave of the failed genetic horrors. The group of patients managed to escape, but the girl was left behind. Her friends now camp above the vault, hoping to one day rescue her from the depths. They speculate that the only way she could have survived is if she assumed the form of one of the monstrosities, forced to roam the halls masquerading as one of them.-->
    <li>story-&gt;这个金库由一群忠诚的朋友看守。地下大厅曾经关押着一位有天赋的病人，她有能力操纵自己的形体。她可以随心所欲地变成任何东西。医生们会拿出乌龟和兔子来测试她的技能，经过痛苦的融化过程，她能够形成一个壳，毫无疑问地变成了一只乌龟。随着时间的推移，这个过程变得过于艰苦，难以忍受。她在其他病人中很受欢迎，他们最后都对她非常怜悯。一天晚上，他们说服女孩化身为一名医生，以进行突破。她成功地乔装打扮，将所有朋友带到了金库门口，但据说却意外地释放了一波失败的基因恐怖。一群病人设法逃脱，但女孩被留下了。她的朋友们现在在金库上方扎营，希望有一天能将她从深渊中救出来。他们推测，她幸存的唯一方法是，如果她变成其中一种怪物的形式，被迫伪装成其中之一在大厅里漫步。</li>
  </VQE_AncientResearchVault.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_AncientResearchVault.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName(priority=1)->E352 - [verb] the seized [place]-->
