    <li>place-&gt;金库</li>
    <!--EN: place->site-->
    <li>place-&gt;网站</li>
  </VQE_AncientResearchVault.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_ArchiteArraySite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==True)->Your radio lights up with another request for E352. The automated satellite ominously claims that this will be your most integral assignment. The voice tells you about an important piece of technology. The most legendary component to the supersoldier program, a device called the archite pathing array. It is meant to manipulate the unpredictable flow of archovapor, potentially doubling your returns. The voice tells you to reach the vault and recover the technology, not stating a clear reason why.\n\nOur objective is to clear the laboratory, and claim the archite pathing array. It can be inferred that there will be hostile forces swarming the site.-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==True)-&gt;您的无线电亮起，发出另一个 E352 请求。自动卫星不祥地声称这将是你最重要的任务。这个声音告诉您一项重要的技术。超级士兵计划中最具传奇色彩的组件是一种名为 archite 路径阵列的设备。它的目的是操纵不可预测的主蒸发流，有可能使您的回报加倍。声音告诉您到达金库并恢复技术，但没有明确说明原因。

我们的目标是清理实验室，并夺取 archite 路径阵列。可以推断，现场将有敌对势力蜂拥而至。</li>
  </VQE_ArchiteArraySite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_ArchiteArraySite.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->E352 - Final Assignment-->
    <li>questName-&gt;E352 - 最终作业</li>
  </VQE_ArchiteArraySite.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_ArchiteControlVault.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==True)->After intercepting the broadcasting station, we have identified an additional ancient laboratory site communicating with the previous. The lab is transmitting a code red signal, likely signifying an even stronger threat presence. It appears some of the monstrosities might have even escaped underground containment and broken onto the surface.\n\nThe site must contain an additional broadcasting station responsible for the message. It is imperative that we also intercept this broadcast on-site, to track where it is broadcasting to. Functioning technology at the site may prove useful in the improvement of supersoldier production. We should look at each piece of equipment carefully to take back with us if we intend to reliably produce supersoldiers of our own.-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==True)-&gt;拦截广播站后，我们发现了另一个与先前的实验室进行通信的古代实验室站点。该实验室正在发送红色代码信号，可能表明存在更严重的威胁。看起来有些怪物甚至可能已经逃离了地下收容并破碎来到了地表。

该站点必须包含一个负责该消息的额外广播站。我们还必须在现场拦截此广播，以跟踪其广播到的位置。现场的功能技术可能有助于提高超级士兵的生产。如果我们打算可靠地生产我们自己的超级士兵，我们应该仔细检查每一件装备，然后带回去。</li>
  </VQE_ArchiteControlVault.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_ArchiteControlVault.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Intercepted supersoldier vault-->
    <li>questName-&gt;拦截的超级士兵金库</li>
  </VQE_ArchiteControlVault.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_InhibitorResearchLab.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==True)->Garbled through the static, it seems some ancient network has mistaken your radio for that of an ancient reconnaissance worker after detecting your travels through an automated satellite.\n\nThe message harshly refers to you as E352, and tasks you with scouting another supersoldier laboratory. Though this broadcast seems to have been running from some time now, it warns of a major uprising event within the lab. Supersoldiers had risen out of containment, and now roam the facility locked inside. The reconnaissance task states that the site was evacuated, yet the uprising was never contained and it is likely some may have escaped.\n\nThe broadcast also contains schematics of the location including your real objective. A device called the mutagen inhibitor core. Though just a prototype prior to its sudden abandonment, it is built to suppress unstable genetic mutations. It is likely that other valuable equipment remains here as well. offering transparent probabilities on genetic experiments. Our objective will be to locate the uplink and uninstall it for use in our own laboratory.-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==True)-&gt;通过静电干扰，似乎某个古老的网络在检测到您通过自动卫星的旅行后，将您的无线电误认为是古代侦察人员的无线电。

该消息严厉地将您称为E352，并要求您侦察另一个超级士兵实验室。虽然这个广播似乎已经开始播放一段时间了，但它警告实验室内将发生重大叛乱事件。超级士兵们已经脱离了收容，现在正在被锁在里面的设施里漫步。侦察任务表明该地点已被疏散，但起义从未被遏制，很可能有些人已经逃脱。

广播还包含该位置的示意图，包括您的真实目标。一种称为诱变剂抑制剂核心的装置。虽然在突然被放弃之前只是一个原型，但它是为了抑制不稳定的基因突变而构建的。其他有价值的设备很可能也留在这里。为基因实验提供一个透明人参与了性行为。的概率。我们的目标是找到上行链路并将其卸载以供我们自己的实验室使用。</li>
  </VQE_InhibitorResearchLab.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_InhibitorResearchLab.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->E352 - Reconnaissance request-->
    <li>questName-&gt;E352 - 侦察请求</li>
  </VQE_InhibitorResearchLab.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_SpliceframeBlacksite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==True)->The intercepted transmission is an urgent distress call from an additional covert laboratory site codenamed "Spliceframe Blacksite". The broadcast warns that the entire laboratory has been compromised after a disaster, falling to a sudden massive infestation of insectoids drawn toward a chemical leak.\n\nThe broadcast refers to a useful genetic device called a spliceframe uplink capable of offering transparent probabilities on genetic experiments. Our objective is to locate the uplink and uninstall it for use in our own laboratory. We should approach well prepared to deal with a large insectoid threat.-->
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==True)-&gt;截获的传输是来自一个代号为“Spliceframe Blacksite”的额外秘密实验室站点的紧急遇险呼叫。该广播警告说，整个实验室在一场灾难后受到了损害，由于突然大规模的类昆虫侵扰而导致化学品泄漏。

该广播提到了一种称为剪接帧上行链路的有用遗传装置，能够为基因实验提供一个透明人参与了性行为。的概率。我们的目标是找到上行链路并将其卸载以供我们自己的实验室使用。我们应该做好充分准备来应对巨大的类昆虫威胁。</li>
  </VQE_SpliceframeBlacksite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VQE_SpliceframeBlacksite.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Infested supersoldier lab-->
    <li>questName-&gt;被感染的超级士兵实验室</li>
  </VQE_SpliceframeBlacksite.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
</LanguageData>
